    <string name="air_provider">Air Provider</string>
    <string name="air_provider_explainer">Carry other AirChat users\' calls, video and files over Wi-Fi, so the network reaches further. Nothing is kept for people out of reach. Everything stays encrypted: you cannot read it or tell whose it is.</string>
