    <string name="air_provider_hot">The phone is hot: Air Provider waits until it cools down</string>
    <string name="air_provider_warning">Your phone will carry other people\'s calls, video and files, encrypted, over Wi-Fi. This uses battery: above 50% it carries everything, from 20% calls only, and below 20% or when the phone gets hot it turns itself off. Calls and files it took on are carried to the end. It keeps nothing for people out of reach.</string>
